  <info><![CDATA[## WHAT IS IT?

LANA Model v3.0 — Lateralized Artificial Neural Architecture.
Protocol v3.0 FINAL compatible. Based on CODE_REVIEW_REVISED.

## HOW TO USE IT

1. Click Setup to initialize the network
2. Click Go to run continuously
3. Use BASELINE? to toggle baseline mode
4. Use LOG-CSV? to enable data logging
5. Use Tools > BehaviorSpace for experiments E0-E6]]></info>
